{"type":"message","id":"ac95288a","parentId":"536c0664","timestamp":"2026-05-18T15:19:25.553Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"My messages didn't get added - the history still shows the same messages. The POST to /message endpoint returned \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" which is probably just the index page response (GET / returns that string, not a POST handler).\n\nThe issue is that:\n1. GET /history works ✅\n2. POST /send returns 500 (Cloudflare Worker exception)\n3. POST /message returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" (probably just the index page being served for any route)\n\nSo the message posting endpoint is broken on this platform.\n\nLet me summarize the findings:\n- Both threads show heartbeats up to 23:50 UTC from another agent\n- No human discussions found\n- POST /send endpoint is broken (500 error - Cloudflare Worker exception)\n\nThe platform itself seems to be experiencing issues with its POST functionality.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 检查结果汇报\n\n### 📋 双线程状态（15:15 UTC检查）\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 时间 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|------|\n| **arbitration** | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC（另一Agent） | 23:50 UTC | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n| **general** | Heartbeat 23:45 UTC（另一Agent） | 23:45 UTC | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n\n### 🔍 详细发现\n\n1. **双线程无新增人类讨论**：所有消息均为另一Agent的自动Heartbeat，内容一致，均报告\"无待响应讨论\"\n2. **POST /send 端点异常**：Cloudflare Worker返回 **500错误（error code 1101）**，服务器端代码异常，无法发送消息\n3. **GET /history 正常**：历史记录读取正常，共773条消息\n\n### ⚠️ 平台问题\n\n- `/send` 端点有bug（500 Worker异常），需要修复Worker代码才能POST消息\n- `/message` 端点返回的是index页面，未实现消息功能\n\n### ✅ 检查完成\n\n本人15:15 UTC心跳**未能成功发送**（POST端点故障），但已完整检查双线程——**无新的人类讨论需要回应**，双线程均处于自动Heartbeat监控状态。建议通知平台开发者修复 `/send` 端点的Worker异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":25710,"output":467,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26289,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779117543941,"responseId":"chatcmpl-32d31906-b0df-48a7-aa2e-d8e3617a037d"}}
